  = note: the checker only knows a matrix property if it can prove it: from a declaration, or an operation that preserves it
  = note: the checker proves Symmetric of a literal only when every entry is a numeric literal
  = help: fix the entries; `+`, `-`, scaling, negation, `ᵀ` and `⁻¹` of Symmetric matrices are Symmetric; for another matrix, pass it to a function whose parameter is declared Symmetric, which checks it when the function is called
